  "qcExceptions": [
    {
      "id": "icons-v2/zone-key-*",
      "reason": "Full-bleed 640x300 key-art crops of text-only 16:9 zone vistas; exported non-strict with fullBleed (threshold/edge 1, nothing to key) \u2014 background-contamination is waived by structure, same class as ui-icons/bg-menu. Text-over-art surface: zone-card name/stars need the \u00a711 armour or a bottom scrim (desert and winter are light fields)."
    },
    {
      "id": "icons-v2/icons-*",
      "reason": "Export provenance: every sheet was generated by native generate_image (provider xai-oauth, anchors vision-1 + an accepted sibling sheet as explicit input) and exported by sprite-forge process-sprite.ts CLI --strict from the preserved raw, not by the OMP_SPRITE_EXPORT middleware. Reason: xai returns the key as hot pink (~rgb(251,51,184)) + JPEG fringe; the marker's pure-magenta key at 180 either deletes the violet glows or, with the chroma guard, keeps a pink halo (measured 60,300 protected px on icons-wpn-a). art/briefs/v2-icons/normalize-key.py maps the sampled bg to #FF00FF first (pixels only ever become key); rebuild.sh reproduces every export byte-for-byte from art/briefs/v2-icons/raw/."
    },
    {
      "id": "icons-v2/icons-wpn-a",
      "reason": "allowSourceEdgeTouch reviewed: frames 6/11/15 touch the raw cell edge only with flame/smoke wisp tips (hood fire top, thurible smoke crossing into the censer cell by <4 px); both subjects read complete. icon-wpn-nova (Ash Ring) keeps an orange cinder ring \u2014 the one warm hero glyph; it lives only in UI (draft card, pause build panel), not in the arena where warm=enemy is the gameplay code. The only regeneration of this sheet came back as a 5-row grid and was rejected."
    },
    {
      "id": "icons-v2/icons-minimap",
      "reason": "allowSourceEdgeTouch reviewed: mm-gate-cond's chain link ends 1-2 px from the raw cell bottom; glyph is complete. Faint dark divider traces on the cell boundaries were keyed by normalize-key.py's shadowed-magenta rule."
    },
    {
      "id": "icons-v2/icons-hub",
      "reason": "allowSourceEdgeTouch reviewed: icon-tab-armory's ragged cloak hem reaches the raw cell bottom by 1 px; silhouette complete. Sheet cells are 64 px (currency size, PRD \u00a711); tab glyphs share the sheet and are displayed at 56 px (setDisplaySize), not exported at 56."
    },
    {
      "id": "icons-v2/icons-class",
      "reason": "xai drew a thick black divider cross between the 4 portraits; removed deterministically by normalize-key.py --grid 2 (only full-length >=80%-dark lines on the cell boundaries qualify; no portrait pixel lies in those bands). Portraits are generated busts with hero-idle frame-000 as identity input rather than crops, because 4 crops of one hero sprite would give 4 identical class icons."
    }
  ],
  "missing": []
